KinOrder  30  (Max order in the kinetic energy expansion)
PotOrder  16  (Max order in the potential energy expansion)

Natoms 4       (Number of atoms)
Nmodes 6       (Number of modes = 3*Natoms-6)

(ACTIVE SPACE CUTOFFS:)
PRIMITIVES
  Npolyads    36       (how many polyads we calculate)
  enercut    60000.   (energy cut in the primitive matrix for the diagonalization)
END

contraction
  npolyads     36
  enercut       80000.0
  coeff_thresh  1.0e-14
  degeneracy    1e-2
  sample_points  40
  sample_attempts 500
  symm_toler      1e-3
end


SYMGROUP   Cs(M)


DIAGONALIZER
  SYEV
  enermax 15000
end

dstep 0.005    (finite difference element for each mode )

COORDS     local
frame      BC-Z-CD-X
TRANSFORM  r1-r2-r3-a1-rho2-tau-abs
MOLTYPE    abcd
REFER-CONF non-RIGID  (Reference configuarion: RIGID or NON-RIGID)
